121x121 torus, one ant, heading 0 = north

  100 steps:   20 black cells; matches reference: TRUE
  500 steps:   62 black cells; matches reference: TRUE
 2000 steps:  202 black cells; matches reference: TRUE

  From an all-white field the trajectory is chaotic for about 10,000
  steps and then locks into a period-104 highway; the figure runs on
  to 11,500 steps to show it.
